WEBVTT

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.860
The rep's tough! Inuzuka can't lift a finger!

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.800
I don't like making a mockery of people.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.910
Won't you just come quietly?

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.580
I refuse!

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.120
Well, suit yourself.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.270
It's the fairy dance!

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:34.510
-I can't let you tarnish the White Cats' good name.
-He's the best!

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.900
His strength is different than my brother's.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.770
And the students have the utmost faith in him.

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:46.540
Prefects... The top of this world's food chain.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.500
As expected, they're something else.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.400
I can't stand against them as I am now.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.090
Do I have to surpass these two

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:57.170
if I want to be able to change the world?

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:59.160
What a thorny path!

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.310
This is no good.

00:01:12.310 --> 00:01:16.550
I can't let Persia see me
looking so pathetic!

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.030
I'll admit it.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:21.890
I'm no match for you as I am now. But just for now!

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:25.060
Trying to bamboozle me while you're in full view?

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:27.310
Not me, look at your legs.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:32.420
Oh, incredible! When did that happen?

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.830
Now I can't kick you at all!

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:36.820
Is this really the time to be impressed?

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:39.450
You’re taking this lightly.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.200
But that's fine, you're not my target today!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.460
Wait, we're on the third floor!

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:47.220
I'm aware!

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:56.440
Inuzuka!

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:58.440
I heard it.

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:00.200
It was faint,

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.100
but I heard Persia calling!

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:04.600
Inuzuka!

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:08.330
He's gone. That's impossible.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:13.110
So, he got involved with it.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:13.990
Romio and Juliet

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:15.790
Airu, there's trouble!
Romio and Juliet

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:18.450
A first-year of ours is on a rampage
at the White Cats House!
Romio and Juliet

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:18.840
A first-year of ours is on a rampage
at the White Cats House!

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.170
A first-year?

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:22.990
We heard he was crashing Juliet Persia's birthday party!

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.680
You saved me. Thanks.

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.490
But I heard you were in the corner room...

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:37.030
That's right.

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:40.550
-I climbed out my window and over to this balcony.
-What?

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:43.940
You did something that dangerous? That's insane!

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:47.830
Insane? Who's the insane one, you idiot?

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:53.310
Why did you even come here?

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.510
I was

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:58.320
worried about you.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:06.740
Happy birthday!

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:11.260
I-I never got to tell you.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.440
That's why I came here.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:16.890
You did all this to tell me that?

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:18.680
Yeah.

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:23.510
You got everyone riled up, and got yourself hurt again...

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:27.310
Even though I said I didn't want to see you?

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:31.340
Even though I told you
I didn't want you to get hurt over me.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:34.660
Physical wounds will heal in time.

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:38.900
But the pain of being rejected by you
would never disappear!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.410
I'll come find you wherever you are,
as many times as it takes.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:49.040
-You're such an idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!
-Say it all you like.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:53.180
But...

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:55.040
I'm an idiot, too.

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:58.230
When I heard you'd come...

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:03.320
I was so, so happy.

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:08.840
I was lying about not wanting to see you.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:11.310
I love you. I really love you!

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:25.890
Inuzuka?

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.510
Are you crying?

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:30.350
I'm not crying at all.

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.400
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.330
I wasn't worried.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:42.340
Between our two houses, there is a great barrier.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:47.250
One of race, ideals, class...

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:52.040
This boarding school of 1000 students is its own world.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:56.080
We follow certain rules and codes
in order to coexist here.

00:04:56.740 --> 00:05:01.530
But you, you climbed over that barrier with ease.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:05.420
Today's incident made me understand.

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:11.130
You've shown me that instead of running in fear
from things that would harm us,

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:14.660
we can face whatever comes as one,
and overcome it.

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:16.670
As well as

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:21.780
the fact that I want to be by your side from now on.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.670
Whoa! Hey...

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.910
What a sight.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:33.910
As soon as the Black Doggy rep showed up,
they played completely docile.

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:35.190
How fitting.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:37.010
Damn it.

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:40.160
We didn't even get a chance to pie Persia.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:43.420
Now the rep's got us, what a turn of events.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.580
-Hasuki Komai.
-Yes!

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.420
I'm going to search for Romio.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:50.140
I want you to keep an eye on everyone.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.150
R-Roger that.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:54.450
Guess we're all in for a punishment.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:59.330
-Sweet! I bet we can sneak away right now.
-Take one for the team, Hasuki.

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:03.440
-And now, sweet freedom!
-Where do you think you're going?

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.990
Did you really think
you could break into the White Cats House

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:13.610
and get away so easily?

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:15.490
Oh, yeah, this guy is here.

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:19.480
-Curse him and his weird getup.
-It's not a weird getup!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:19.980
White Cats prefect, Rex!

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.480
Rex Journey
White Cats Prefect

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:25.740
The number one, most wild man in the world!

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.240
As a prefect,

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.490
I've donned this to understand how females feel.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:33.810
What do you think? I think it suits me.

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:38.710
I'm aiming to be the kind of man
that can wield both strength and cuteness.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.830
I won't have anyone making fun of that.

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:45.710
-Who is this guy? Wearing something like that...
-Yet he remains strangely manly...

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:52.420
I might be willing to let the two of you off the hook
if you can outdo me in cuteness.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:53.600
It's a match!

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:54.990
Cuteness?

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:57.600
This makes no sense but we've got no choice!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.240
Cuteness Showdown

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.530
Ready, and...
Cuteness Showdown

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:02.350
Moe, moe, kyun!
Cuteness Showdown

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:02.360
Moe, moe, kyun!

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.860
-That wasn't cute!
-He's harsh!

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.370
Hasuki, save us!

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:08.240
-You can do it!
-What?

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:12.740
-I won't go easy on you because you're a girl.
-No, no, no! There's no way!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.550
Seriously?

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:18.840
What the hell are you guys doing?
Get back to the dorm already.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:20.010
Maru!

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:23.350
Wait, Maru, I thought you said
you didn't care about the pie throwing?

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:25.270
Don't tell me you wanted to be involved.

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:27.310
Yeah, right!

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:31.030
Could it be you were worried
and came to watch over us?

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.320
Good lord, guys are such a handful.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.820
He's so hot and cold!

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.600
I'm so not one of those.

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:39.660
N-Now that's what I call cute.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.910
I have lost.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:42.950
Amazing! He defeated a prefect!

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.110
I'll kill you!

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:47.480
Let's go, Persia!

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:49.490
Have at thee, Inuzuka!

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:51.090
Now what?

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.610
It's Inuzuka and Miss Persia!

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:03.370
Damn. So, this year it's a draw?

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:06.050
You ruin my party every year.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:07.630
Next time I'll show you no mercy!

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:09.760
Hey, fellas!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.440
I'd say a double KO counts as a win for us.

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:16.240
We made a mess of Persia's party
for another year straight!

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:17.390
Now, we retreat!

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:19.400
Well done, Inuzuka!

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:20.740
I was wrong about you!

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.240
Lady Persia!

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:25.240
How did he get over there?

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:27.150
Retreat!

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.030
So, you found a solution.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.030
Nice, it worked out.

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:33.780
Everybody freeze.

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.030
Brother...

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:41.540
So, this is where you've been, Romio.

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:44.470
I'll be fine. Persia's watching.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.270
I've just got to stay calm.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.100
Got something to say?

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.550
I'm just here throwing pies, that's all.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:55.320
There are no rules against entering the White Cats dorm.

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:57.300
You can't do anything to punish me.

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:59.060
I've got this! Keep it up!

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:04.290
Is the person you've been colluding with...

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:06.810
Juliet Persia?

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.450
I've been thinking about it.

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:22.080
Despite wearing your obedient disguise around me,

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.290
and your surveillance having almost come to an end,

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.930
why would you throw it all away
to sneak out of the dorm?

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:30.800
Then I realized...

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:35.400
You had a reason that compelled you to do so.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:40.490
And that is...
To spend Juliet Persia's birthday together with her.

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:45.370
Having failed that, you barged in here today.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.940
-Am I wrong?
-You're wrong!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.540
What's this about?

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:52.160
Inuzuka and Persia were colluding?

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:54.190
Are they lovers?

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.200
Foolishness.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.440
Me, collude with this man?

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:01.950
That's an affront. I find no greater insult.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:06.640
You would come here with no proof,
and seek to dishonor me?

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:09.330
Have you no shame as a representative?

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.980
That's right! There's no way Lady Persia would betray us!

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:15.670
You said it! This is an enemy trap!

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.020
I have proof.

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:19.590
Oh, and what would that be?

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:23.090
The rosary that was in Romio's room.

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:28.370
In the West, isn't there a custom
where lovers exchange rosaries?

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:32.200
Furthermore, the symbol drawn on his calendar.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.360
It's on your birthday.

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:39.880
That's all circumstantial.
You can't call that conclusive evidence.

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:43.160
Of course, I have conclusive evidence as well.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:46.250
If it matches the one you own, that would settle it.

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:49.370
Very well, bring it out. Let's confirm it.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:53.350
What might be the matter?

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:54.630
Was it just a bluff?

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:58.150
This was in Romio's room.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:59.630
The bra of a Western student.

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:04.550
I confiscated it as a piece of evidence.

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:09.020
I'll have Kochou confirm whether it's your size or not.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:11.020
He found the worst piece of evidence.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.580
What? A bra!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:14.120
I'll kill you, Inuzuka!

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:15.650
Now they're all turning on me!

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.200
What's that?

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:22.410
-Whose bra is that?
-Who knows? I couldn't answer if I tried!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.920
It can't be!

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:26.160
That's the one I gave him.

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:30.970
Now, Airu, I'd call that sexual harassment!

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:33.140
Big brother the pervert!

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:35.770
-Representative.
-Back off, Cait.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:37.300
Don't speak to me so casually.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:40.270
Back off?

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:43.110
You're in the White Cats House.

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:44.800
So, you get lost.

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:51.810
Seeing as it's come to this,
I'll have to hear some kind of explanation from Persia.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.200
Oh, man, even Representative Cait.

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:57.070
I wouldn't worry,
this is Persia and Inuzuka we're talking about.

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:59.820
Lady Persia... Tell me it's a lie.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:02.420
You've got to be kidding, Inuzuka.

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:05.330
If it's true, I'm sure you know what'll happen to you.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.580
Everyone's doubts are starting to surface!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.580
No matter our explanations, this looks...

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.560
Come. I'll hear your story at the dorm.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:15.710
Persia, I'll have you come with me.

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:24.970
Damn. Is this as far as we go?

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:28.340
Is this... The end?

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:31.570
After overcoming all those obstacles...

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:33.950
It's going to end just like this?

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:40.110
I won't let it. I won't, I won't, I won't!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.360
Persia, I--

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:48.130
Unbelievable.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:49.970
To be doubted in such a manner...

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:53.330
It's more humiliating than you could've hoped.
I'm sure you feel the same.

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:55.900
Draw your sword.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:57.840
You shall duel with me.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.710
A duel with this? This is a real sword!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:05.520
To me, my pride is as valuable as my life.

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:07.570
You have struck a blow to it,

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:09.720
and are trying to belittle me.

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:14.510
In which case, I, on the honor of House Persia,

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:16.980
will fight you even if it costs my life.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:20.580
Is Per really going to duel with real swords?

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:22.740
Are they trying to dispel any doubts?

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:25.210
Don't be stupid! We can't do this!

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:28.130
This is different than pie-throwing and fake swords!

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:29.740
If we make even one mistake...

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.730
This is bad! Someone stop them!

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:44.690
Those are real swords, we can't stop them!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.680
Call the housemaster! Hurry!

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:49.180
Cut the obvious performance.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:51.400
I would ask you stay out of it.

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:55.030
I'm fighting to clear the air
of the unjust charges against me.

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:56.190
But this is dangerous!

00:13:56.460 --> 00:14:00.540
What do we do?
She's stubborn once she’s made up her mind.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.690
This is a bluff.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.530
Romio isn't actually throwing any strikes.

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:08.570
As soon as this farce is over, I'll seize them.

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:14.510
That swing from Persia was for real!

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:17.460
Is she planning on treating this like real combat?

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:21.090
If we really go at it,
neither of us will make it out unscathed.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:23.840
I couldn't live with myself...

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:25.720
Could you not brush me off?

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:28.860
Don't you dare run away, coward.

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:32.570
I've decided to fight you with all my strength.

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:35.580
I've resolved to harm and be harmed!

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.230
In order to protect who I am now!

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:41.830
What about you, Romio Inuzuka?

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.210
I love you.

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:46.460
I really love you!

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.840
The resolve to protect who I am now...

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:54.870
You're right.

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:59.620
The resolve to change the world.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.390
I think that's enough.

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:02.630
Come, Romio.

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:08.610
Don't make me laugh!

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:12.280
You should've backed down
while I was going easy on you.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:14.260
Don't resent me if you wind up dead.

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:17.380
Do your worst.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:20.370
Just make sure your aim is true.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.400
If you miss, your life is mine.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.620
Same to you, you'd better finish it in one blow.

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:27.900
I'm not going down without a fight.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.420
Inuzuka's serious.

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:31.900
This could get ugly.

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:35.160
-It's got to be an act.
-But, if he's serious...

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.410
I want to be with the person I love.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.420
That feeling can never become a sin.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:45.040
Which means, no matter how irrational,
we have to fight to the end!

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:46.800
Inuzuka!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.420
Persia!

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:01.240
Inuzuka!

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:15.280
-That was some crazy stuff.
-Yeah.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:18.290
-We were wrong to doubt him.
-Yeah.

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:22.790
They'd never do something like that if they were lovers.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:28.100
When the reps stepped in,
The tips of the swords were hovering at their throats.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:30.420
That couldn't have been an act.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:33.160
Come on, you guys, go home.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.190
Leave the rest to me.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:37.440
I want to be at Lady Persia's side.

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:39.910
Scott, we're leaving.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.490
Hasuki, let's go.

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:44.910
Yeah.

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:56.050
That went well!

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:58.680
Hey! You're too loud!

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:02.450
It was a dangerous bet.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.530
I'm glad it succeeded.

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:06.790
That was good on-the-spot thinking.

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:10.670
To let the rosaries take the blow.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.860
Thank goodness I had it around my neck.

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.180
Without this, right now...

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:20.450
I'm glad you recognized my signal.

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:22.800
If we hadn't shown our willingness to die,

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:25.250
the reps wouldn't have made a move.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:30.940
I'm sorry the rosary you gave me was destroyed.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:36.320
This rosary was a special one from your mother,
wasn't it?

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:40.330
It was the first present I got from you.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.810
I couldn't even protect something so important.

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:45.760
I'm sorry.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:47.850
We didn't have any other choice.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.690
It couldn't be helped.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.730
Persia?

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:57.980
What's wrong?

00:17:57.980 --> 00:18:01.440
I'm sorry. I was so relieved, I just...

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:05.240
I thought we were done for real this time.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:09.730
Things like this might keep happening.

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:20.050
By the way, I haven't given you your birthday present yet.

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.240
What?

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:25.760
A matching

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:27.550
pair of rings?

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:31.750
I didn't have time to buy anything,
so I found these for cheap at the co-op.

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:35.230
I'd been hesitating to give it to you.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:37.940
We can't even wear them in front of people.

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:40.140
But... I've decided.

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:43.010
I'll become a prefect.

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:47.450
I'll start by changing this school.

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:55.500
When that day comes,

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:58.170
I want you to wear this ring.

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:07.870
C-Can you wait for me until then?

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:13.310
I'll wait as long as I have to.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:16.750
So, show me how cool you can be!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:19.940
You are my boyfriend, you know!

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:28.310
Inuzuka?

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:31.450
Inuzuka? Hey, are you listening?

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:33.210
Hey!

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:37.110
This-- This is simply unheard of.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.610
And-- And the two of you let it happen, pathetic!

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.870
I-- I have no excuse for my actions.

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:44.710
You-- You don't need to imitate me!

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:48.480
Cait! We can tell you're falling asleep!

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:50.370
As for Inuzuka and Persia,

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:53.810
we've confined them to their dorms for a week.

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:57.470
I was so worried! I can't keep doing this!

00:19:57.470 --> 00:19:58.980
I'm sorry.

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:02.760
Still... I'm glad you're okay.

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:06.070
-Hasuki.
-Yeah?

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:10.390
I'm truly grateful to you. Thank you.

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:17.460
I-I'll forgive you this time,
but you have to stop overdoing it!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:19.400
S-Sure, got it.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.780
What? You gave Inuzuka that bra, Char?

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:25.780
I never expected something like this would happen.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.470
I'm really sorry.

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.410
I thought it was strange.

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:33.300
I guess all is well.

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:36.520
We made it out without having our secret exposed.

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:39.920
If you need anything,

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.770
you can talk to me anytime.

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:44.900
Yup! Thanks.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:51.650
They got lucky this time, but the future
looks to be trying for the two of them.

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:55.750
I won't give up my angel so easily.

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:03.130
Inuzuka is the only one at fault.

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:06.950
It's so irritating that Persia had to be punished too!

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.830
I wish I could take her place and be punished instead!

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:14.100
In that case, I'll bestow some punishment upon you.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:16.990
Where do you want it?

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:19.730
Your eyebrows? Your head?

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:22.220
Or perhaps...

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.480
Why?

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:34.850
Taking a row boat with you
after clearing house arrest is awesome!

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:38.160
Don't be so loud!

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:41.360
The next time something like that happens,
we'll have no alibi!

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:46.790
So, Inuzuka...

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:49.930
Are you serious about becoming a prefect?

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:53.390
I met with my brother today.

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:55.930
Romio.

00:21:55.930 --> 00:21:59.560
My doubts about you are not completely gone.

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:05.520
However, that little riot of yours
was the result of my careless endgame.

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:07.390
I'm reflecting on it as such.

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:10.700
I'm going to leave it at that.

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:14.140
So never do something like this again.

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:20.460
Brother! I want to aim for prefecthood!

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:28.470
And that was him giving his consent?

00:22:28.470 --> 00:22:31.440
For now, I'm going to try starting as an errand boy.

00:22:31.440 --> 00:22:34.290
-So, you'll be in charge of daily duties?
-Yeah.

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:39.850
Romio's going to be our errand boy?

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:42.940
That's right. I'll be at your service.

00:22:43.550 --> 00:22:48.450
That must mean you want to spend entire days with us.

00:22:48.450 --> 00:22:51.780
I knew you've been looking at me
with those naughty eyes.

00:22:51.780 --> 00:22:53.310
That is not the case.

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:55.560
If I can learn about prefects,

00:22:55.560 --> 00:22:57.740
that should be a good start.

00:23:02.660 --> 00:23:03.940
Don't give up!

00:23:08.420 --> 00:23:10.950
Then someday...

00:23:11.800 --> 00:23:13.860
-What was that?
-Nothing.

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.090
Forget it.

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:18.030
-You said something. Tell me.
-I didn't.

00:23:18.030 --> 00:23:19.470
I'm super curious!

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:21.850
Hey! Don't rock the boat!

00:23:23.430 --> 00:23:27.690
Help me! I can't swim! I'll die!

00:23:27.690 --> 00:23:29.650
You're hopeless.

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:34.770
Then someday...

00:23:34.770 --> 00:23:38.230
With no one in our way, we won't hold back.

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:42.980
-We'll call each other "Romio" and "Juliet"!
-We'll call each other "Romio" and "Juliet"!
